<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.keep.reseats ~ the keep pair binds again to a route the vessel proves

`lares vault reseat` proves a typed route against the vessel's held key (against the files where no vessel stands) and reseats the keep pair on the human routes it proved (`--passphrase` or `--paper` names which route to gather). Under a pūlama the route rides the pūlama's own hand door and this door refuses. A credential rides a TTY alone: no flag, no environment variable and no pipe carries one, nothing echoes one, and it drops the instant the act returns.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ reseat · paper

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`reseat` params=`~ prove a route and reseat the keep pair`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`paper` params=`paper/true ~ prove a paper route`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ passphrase · paper

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`passphrase` params=`kind/switch needs/one-of:passphrase,paper ~ gather a passphrase route`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`paper` params=`kind/switch needs/one-of:passphrase,paper ~ gather a paper route`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/route ~ a person types the route at their own terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ keep-seat-at-pulama · daemon-unreachable · keep-seat-unseatable · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-seat-at-pulama` params=`~ a pūlama keeps custody; run its keep-seat at its own hand door`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-unreachable` params=`cure/[[face.keep.reseats]] ~ the vessel stopped answering before the proof landed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`keep-seat-unseatable` params=`~ the proved route holds no human route the keep binds (a passkey alone); nothing changed`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the custody door's named refusals lead the line by class (OccupiedStoreRefusal, CustodyRefusal, TreeKeyRefusal, CensusRefusal, CustodyLockRefused, CustodyFoundingRefused, CredentialTtyRefusal, RotationSlotsRefused), exit 1`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ reseated

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`reseated` params=`exit/0 fields/[[reseated]] ~ the keep pair stands on the proved routes`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

